   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "12a6e9b8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Task 5 - Estimated vs Actual Weight plotting 📈\n",
    "### Standardising Units\n",
    "Next was to create a plot of the estimated weight of the pumpkins against the actual weights.\n",
    "\n",
    "This can be done in a number of ways but the important thing to note is that both axis require the same units. One could plot the `est_weight` against the `weight` in lbs using the data already available in the dataset, but to make use of the function created in task 3, the values were plotted in kilograms.\n",
    "\n",
    "A new column in the dataset was created called `est_weight_kg` using the code below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "2d622192",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "pumpkins[f\"est_weight_kg\"] = [(lbs_to_kg(i)) for i in pumpkins['est_weight']]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "764129ae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "This new set column of data (`est_weight_kg`) can be plotted against the `weight_in_kg` column to see the relationship.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Creating the graph\n",
    "The module matplotlib is used to create graphs and is imported."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "6ae63b21",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4629892c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Next a plot of the two columns can be created. \n",
    "\n",
    "Note: The `plt.figure` command was used here as it makes my later comparison easier to deal with."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "fig-estimated_vs_actual",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 672x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {
      "image/png": {
       "height": 449,
       "width": 601
      }
     },
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "#| label: fig-estimated_vs_actual\n",
    "#| fig-cap: A Scatterplot of the relationship between the estimated weight and the actual weight of pumpkins from the pumpkin competitions dataset.\n",
    "figure_1 = plt.figure() #Creates a new figure to draw graph on\n",
    "plot_area_1 = figure_1.add_subplot() #Creates a new plotting area inside figure_1 to make axes\n",
    "plot_area_1.scatter(x = pumpkins['est_weight_kg'],y = pumpkins['weight_in_kg'],alpha = 0.25, color = 'blue') #Creating the relationship graph\n",
    "plot_area_1.set_title('Estimated Pumpkin Weight vs Actual Pumpkin Weight') #Adding title and axis labels\n",
    "plot_area_1.set_xlabel('Estimated Weight (kg)') #Adding x axis label\n",
    "plot_area_1.set_ylabel('Actual Weight (kg)'); #Adding y axis label\n",
    "#figure_1.show() - This line is commented as it does not function corectly in markdown"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "16b33795",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
