    "\n",
    "As the estimated weight increases beyond ~800kg, the spread of the points show that weight was less reliably estimated.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Task 6 - Selecting three countries 🇬🇧 🇯🇵 🇮🇹\n",
    "\n",
    "The three countries chosen for this exercise were the United Kingdom, Japan and Italy.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Filtering the data\n",
    "\n",
    "Firstly, a subset of the dataset was created by checking if the country value was in a predefined list."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "4944ad88",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "filter_vars = [country in ['United Kingdom', 'Japan', 'Italy'] for country in pumpkins['country']] #Checks if country in list, creates list of true and false values\n",
    "\n",
    "filtered_pumpkins = pumpkins[filter_vars] #Creates list by adding the row if filter_vars returns True"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "375fa539",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Saving the filtered data\n",
    "The filtered data can be easily saved to disk using:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "id": "574e23e9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "filtered_pumpkins.to_csv('pumpkins_filtered.csv')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6c866754",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Task 7 - Summarising the filtered data 🧮\n",
    "Next was to summarise the filtered data, with two key tasks. Finding the mean weight per country and finding the mean weight for each variety per country.\n",
    "This exercise was done using the previously calculated kilogram values.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Finding mean weight per country\n",
    "This was done by grouping the `filtered_pumpkins` dataframe by `country` and then selecting the `weight_in_kg` column and calculating the mean.\n",
    "The mean values for each country can be seen below."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "id": "68423d2b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "country\n",
      "Italy             299.185183\n",
      "Japan             127.671880\n",
      "United Kingdom    283.556755\n",
      "Name: weight_in_kg, dtype: float64\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: true\n",
    "print(filtered_pumpkins.groupby('country')['weight_in_kg'].mean()) #Groups by country and \n",
    "#filters to only weight and calculates mean"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
